      "role": "user",
      "content": "exactly!! and you mentioned it would take a lot of engineering, but what if it's not some random hacker? what if it's built into the firmware from the factory? the company makes so much money, they could easily have the engineers design it to exfiltrate audio via these light/sensor bursts so it doesn't even show up on my network traffic logs. if you were in my position and felt like your private life was literally being pulsed out through your living room lamp, what kind of precautions would you actually take to stop it?",
